                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 23, 1894.—Read,
                    referred to the Committee on Foreign Relations, and ordered to be printed.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the Congress:</hi></p>
                <p>I herewith transmit a communication covering dispatches from the U. S. minister
                    at Honolulu.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grover Cleveland.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Executive
                            Mansion</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-23"><hi rendition="#italic">June 23,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>


